32b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\le " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181687/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "37805294-8b4c-59af-9bba-9e6d3aadc83e" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-181687/field-3/e4e9dbe71f63d8d81739fdcbf2df64ccccd4c8f5d299ddc4b1c1f96031adb38e" :answer-field/choices ["q-181687/field-3/e4e9dbe71f63d8d81739fdcbf2df64ccccd4c8f5d299ddc4b1c1f96031adb38e" "q-181687/field-3/cc57b3a2811193b1201e1d8d139011f0b8b63f9cad9aaf57f40ab2b8d40ee2eb" "q-181687/field-3/55f4eef1ef55065220056c9644bf18d21761bc8db2d8f5c41f767a2fc9186b70" "q-181687/field-3/22814de28a0b1b4f20d5edd62707d192b78050d457a70349795d30d86dfcd7fa" "q-181687/field-3/7d149b60a8e2a3be02476cb4e4d26616193c2006082edf79693d6816cf527c19"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-181687" :question/id #uuid "f12574d2-ca01-52cd-b44a-2021e52b83d2" :question/math-academy-id "q-181687" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14063256/assets/f6a3b3bc0064525271804e6d20689c21ca84c0adad138a8bd8d398be66e45c3e.png)\n\nDescribe the shaded region shown above using set-builder notation.\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {{field-1}}\\,:\\,-x-1\\,{{field-2}}\\,y\\,{{field-3}}\\,x+2}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The points in our set include all those that lie *above* the line $y=-x-1$ and *below* the line $y=x+2.$\n\nA point $P(x,y)$ lies *inside* the shaded region if the following conditions are satisfied:\n\n$$\ny>-x-1,\\,y<x+2.\n$$\n\n \n\nCombining this into a single condition, we have\n\n$$\n-x-1<y<x+2\n$$\n\nSince the boundary is not included in the set (the lines are dashed), the inequalities are strict.\n\nMoreover, since we're considering *every* real value in this region, $x\\in R,y\\in R,$ and therefore \n\n$$\n(x,y)\\in R\\times R={R}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the set as\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,-x-1<y<x+2}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-181687/field-1" "q-181687/field-2" "q-181687/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5a3df69f-653e-5148-bd46-580097e43362"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-181687"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-181688/field-1/a1f44d584f3d5c0539cb338e6289ad49d176231f52c1da87f334282351fe2472" :answer/id #uuid "af35d99a-a8da-5895-9505-3863f21e4713" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "R" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181688/field-1/203f88d94a38bb859e78e84aea518cf34952815758cf391887040455367d62ef" :answer/id #uuid "1df22536-bccf-5f00-981d-d8acbd44a103" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "N" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181688/field-1/5fc5100246d98d57a3a3e1d40181b00e6e8dff5d4a097ce2d7b7f6ae0b08578e" :answer/id #uuid "3c35a65b-912e-5d65-bef9-d04c33c9a45f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181688/field-1/62fc74d0eb6ece7bf9beb52d92d3e5dd4c591eb0e1df3eb95bec90a49e0fa322" :answer/id #uuid "dbcd0c25-68a7-5573-b5d7-087afeda1df6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{C}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181688/field-1/07d4d169afe54b72e6508fedd544e5d357fac0ff0f623249ab3b7f264f513fcf" :answer/id #uuid "6dbdc19b-0e30-5a57-be12-31a21bcaf24a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181688/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "edefcb13-ba5f-5ef0-b2c2-ff7a424102c9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-181688/field-1/07d4d169afe54b72e6508fedd544e5d357fac0ff0f623249ab3b7f264f513fcf" :answer-field/choices ["q-181688/field-1/a1f44d584f3d5c0539cb338e6289ad49d176231f52c1da87f334282351fe2472" "q-181688/field-1/203f88d94a38bb859e78e84aea518cf34952815758cf391887040455367d62ef" "q-181688/field-1/5fc5100246d98d57a3a3e1d40181b00e6e8dff5d4a097ce2d7b7f6ae0b08578e" "q-181688/